menu "Muse radar page"

config MUSE_RADAR_ENABLED
    bool "Radar page"
    default y
    help
        Adds a swipe page showing what is moving around a place you pick:
        aircraft overhead, ships in a strait, or where the rain is. The
        page's own settings choose the range, which of the three to show,
        and the place. Setting the range to Off takes the page out of the
        tileview without rebuilding.

config MUSE_RADAR_AIS_KEY
    string "aisstream.io API key (ships)"
    default ""
    depends on MUSE_RADAR_ENABLED
    help
        Ships come from aisstream.io, which is free but wants a key: sign in
        with GitHub at https://aisstream.io/account and make one. Left empty,
        the Ships mode says so on screen and fetches nothing. Planes and
        weather need no key at all.

endmenu
